        <item>
            <title>0.2.23</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 09:43:12 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/serafimcloud/firstlight-releases/releases/tag/0.2.23</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/serafimcloud/firstlight-releases/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>32</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.23</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Agents on every Mac add up

FIXED
Agents running on two Macs signed in to the same account now add up instead of one Mac's count replacing the other's. Install Firstlight on the Mac where your agents run and both show on your profile.

IMPROVED
Settings no longer offers a public page before you have a username; it takes you to pick one first.
]]></description>
