        <item>
            <title>0.2.22</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 18:38:58 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/serafimcloud/firstlight-releases/releases/tag/0.2.22</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/serafimcloud/firstlight-releases/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>31</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.22</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Declining a friend request stays between you

CHANGED
Declining a friend request no longer tells the person who sent it: on their side it still reads as sent, and on their profile you can still accept it.
Adding back someone whose request you declined makes you friends at once.

IMPROVED
On a profile with nothing under the name, hovering the app or agents badge slides the profile down instead of making it jump.
]]></description>
